message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "gaspin"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for the analysis of molecular dynamics trajectories of atomic gases: classification of the
  collision events, event statistics, energetically bound clusters, and ensemble averages of distance-dependent
  pair properties such as NMR parameters.
authors:
